This is a modified version of LianAi Keyboard (恋爱键盘), which is itself
derived from Vertick IME.

Modification notice (GPL-3.0 section 5a), 2026-10:
- Removed subscription, membership, account and purchase features, together
  with the built-in "帮你回 / 超会说" entry points and their backend clients.
- Added a user-configurable OpenAI-compatible AI chat panel that accepts images
  as conversation context.
- Chinese keyboard fixed to the 26-key layout; the number row is hidden and key
  geometry is derived from screen width.
- Application id changed to com.weike.aikeyboard; UI text and launcher entry
  changed.

